B9J08_000834	FUNCTION: May play a role in lipid metabolism.
B9J08_000846	FUNCTION: Component of the OBSOLETE complex, a complex that regulates the turnover of the translation initiation factor eIF4E.
B9J08_000859	FUNCTION: Plays a role in cell wall biogenesis and integrity.
