B9J08_001053	FUNCTION: Palmitoyltransferase that probably catalyzes the addition of palmitate onto various protein substrates and is involved in a variety of cellular processes Has no stringent fatty acid selectivity and in addition to palmitate can also transfer onto target proteins myristate from tetradecanoyl-CoA and stearate from octadecanoyl-CoA
B9J08_001054	FUNCTION: Flagellar protein that affects chemotactic events.
