B9J08_001189	FUNCTION: Probably involved in lipid transport.
B9J08_001195	FUNCTION: Probably plays a role in cytokinesis.
B9J08_001197	FUNCTION: May play a role in the control of cellular morphogenesis and cytokinesis.
